---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
const SITE_NAME = import.meta.env.SITE_NAME || "Site Name";

---

<Layout
  title={`${SITE_NAME} - DMCA Policy`}
  description={`${SITE_NAME} - DMCA Policy`}
  keywords={`${SITE_NAME}, ${SITE_NAME} dmca policy`}
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    <div class="mx-3 prose max-w-none prose-invert p-8">
      <div>
        <h1>DMCA Policy</h1>
        <p>
          This page outlines our approach to copyright concerns in accordance
          with the Digital Millennium Copyright Act (DMCA).
        </p>

        <h2>Copyright Notice</h2>
        <p>
          We respect the intellectual property rights of others and expect users
          to do the same. Our website provides scheduling information and links
          to third-party streaming platforms. We do not host, upload, or control
          any video content available on external websites.
        </p>

        <h2>No Content Hosting</h2>
        <p>
          This platform գործում as a directory and aggregator of publicly
          available links. All streaming content is hosted and managed by
          independent third-party providers. We do not store, transmit, or
          manage any copyrighted media on our servers.
        </p>

        <h2>DMCA Takedown Requests</h2>
        <p>
          If you believe that content linked on our website infringes your
          copyright, we recommend contacting the hosting provider directly, as
          they control the actual content. However, if you believe there is a
          valid concern related to our website, please include the following
          details in your request:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>Your full name, address, phone number, and email address</li>
          <li>A clear description of the copyrighted work in question</li>
          <li>
            The exact URL or location on our site where the material appears
          </li>
          <li>
            A statement confirming your good faith belief that the use is
            unauthorized
          </li>
          <li>
            A declaration that the information provided is accurate, under
            penalty of perjury
          </li>
          <li>
            Your physical or electronic signature (as the copyright owner or
            authorized agent)
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Counter-Notification</h2>
        <p>
          If you believe that content was removed or disabled by mistake, you
          may submit a counter-notification. This should include your contact
          details, identification of the affected content, a statement of good
          faith belief that the removal was in error, consent to jurisdiction,
          and your signature.
        </p>

        <h2>Repeat Infringers</h2>
        <p>
          We reserve the right to restrict or terminate access for users who
          repeatedly violate copyright policies. Additionally, links to external
          sources reported and verified as infringing may be removed from our
          directory.
        </p>

        <h2>DMCA Contact</h2>
        <p>
          To submit a DMCA notice or inquiry, please use our contact page and
          include “DMCA Notice” in the subject line to ensure proper handling.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
